arent;box-shadow:inset 0 0 0 1.5px rgba(255,255,255,.28);animation-delay:681ms\"></span></span></div><div class=\"grid grid-cols-[7.5rem_1fr] sm:grid-cols-[10rem_1fr] gap-3 items-start\"><span class=\"text-[13px] leading-tight pt-px text-white/80\">Възраждане</span><span class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-[3px]\"><span title=\"Коста Георгиев Стоянов: против\" class=\"board-dot inline-block rounded-full\" style=\"width:10px;height:10px;background:#d2353f;animation-delay:684ms\"></span><span title=\"Ангел Василев Янчев: против\" class=\"board-dot inline-block rounded-full\" style=\"width:10px;height:10px;background:#d2353f;animation-delay:687ms\"></span><span title=\"Георги Николаев Георгиев: против\" class=\"board-dot inline-block rounded-full\" style=\"width:10px;height:10px;background:#d2353f;animation-delay:690ms\"></span><span title=\"Ивелин Първанов Първанов: против\" class=\"board-dot inline-block rounded-full\" style=\"width:10px;height:10px;background:#d2353f;animation-delay:693ms\"></span><span title=\"Димо Георгиев Дренчев: против\" class=\"board-dot inline-block rounded-full\" style=\"width:10px;height:10px;background:#d2353f;animation-delay:696ms\"></span><span title=\"Борис Димитров Аладжов: против\" class=\"board-dot inline-block rounded-full\" style=\"width:10px;height:10px;background:#d2353f;animation-delay:699ms\"></span><span title=\"Ангел Жеков Георгиев: против\" class=\"board-dot inline-block rounded-full\" style=\"width:10px;height:10px;background:#d2353f;animation-delay:700ms\"></span><span title=\"Кръстьо Стоянов Врачев: против\" class=\"board-dot inline-block rounded-full\" style=\"width:10px;height:10px;background:#d2353f;animation-delay:700ms\"></span><span title=\"Цончо Томов Ганев: против\" class=\"board-dot inline-block rounded-full\" style=\"width:10px;height:10px;background:#d2353f;animation-delay:700ms\"></span><span title=\"Петър Николаев Петров: против\" class=\"board-dot inline-block rounded-full\" style=\"width:10px;height:10px;background:#d2353f;animation-delay:700ms\"></span><span title=\"Костадин Тодоров Костадинов: отсъства\" class=\"board-dot inline-block rounded-full\" style=\"width:10px;height:10px;background:transparent;box-shadow:inset 0 0 0 1.5px rgba(255,255,255,.28);animation-delay:700ms\"></span><span title=\"Искра Михайлова Михайлова: отсъства\" class=\"board-dot inline-block rounded-full\" style=\"width:10px;height:10px;background:transparent;box-shadow:inset 0 0 0 1.5px rgba(255,255,255,.28);animation-delay:700ms\"></span></span></div></div><p class=\"mt-5 text-[15px] text-white/85 num\"><b class=\"text-white\">Прието</b> с <!-- -->127<!-- --> гласа „за“, <!-- -->31<!-- --> „против“ и <!-- -->36<!-- --> „въздържал се“. <!-- -->46<!-- --> не гласуваха.</p><p class=\"mt-3 text-sm text-white/70\">На <!-- -->20 ноември 2026 г.<!-- --> е имало <!-- -->26<!-- --> гласувания. <a class=\"text-white underline\" href=\"/parlament#zasedaniya\">Виж всички</a>. Данните се обновяват автоматично всяка сутрин и вечер в дните на заседания.</p></div></div></section><section class=\"grid grid-cols-2 gap-3 sm:gap-5 lg:grid-cols-4 mt-8 sm:mt-10 mb-12 sm:mb-16\"><div class=\"bg-surface rounded-lg p-4 sm:p-5 flex flex-col\"><p class=\"text-sm sm:text-[15px] text-muted\">Държавен дълг, 2025</p><p class=\"display num text-[2rem] sm:text-[3.4rem] leading-none mt-2 break-words text-ink\">29,9%</p><p class=\"text-sm sm:text-[15px] mt-2\">от БВП · +6,2 пр.п. за година</p><div class=\"mt-auto pt-3 flex flex-wrap justify-between gap-x-2 gap-y-1 text-xs sm:text-sm\"><span class=\"text-muted\">Източник: <a href=\"https://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/databrowser/view/gov_10dd_edpt1/default/table\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\">Евростат</a></span><a class=\"font-semibold\" href=\"/pari/dalg\">Виж повече</a></div></div><div class=\"bg-surface rounded-lg p-4 sm:p-5 flex flex-col\"><p class=\"text-sm sm:text-[15px] text-muted\">Инфлация, октомври 2026 г.</p><p class=\"display num text-[2rem] sm:text-[3.4rem] leading-none mt-2 break-words text-ink\">6,0%</p><p class=\"text-sm sm:text-[15px] mt-2\">на година · най-много поскъпва: транспорт и горива (+26,2%)</p><div class=\"mt-auto pt-3 flex flex-wrap justify-between gap-x-2 gap-y-1 text-xs sm:text-sm\"><span class=\"text-muted\">Източник: <a href=\"https://www.nsi.bg/press-release/inflaciya-i-indeksi-na-potrebitelskite-ceni-oktomvri-2026-godina-9216\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\">НСИ</a></span><a class=\"font-semibold\" href=\"/kalkulatori/lichna-inflaciya\">Виж повече</a></div></div><div class=\"bg-surface rounded-lg p-4 sm:p-5 flex flex-col\"><p class=\"text-sm sm:text-[15px] text-muted\">Минимална заплата, 2026</p><p class=\"display num text-[2rem] sm:text-[3.4rem] leading-none mt-2 break-words text-ink\">620,20 €</p><p class=\"text-sm sm:text-[15px] mt-2\">бруто · нето ≈ 481,26 €</p><div class=\"mt-auto pt-3 flex flex-wrap justify-between gap-x-2 gap-y-1 text-xs sm:text-sm\"><span class=\"text-muted\">Източник: <a href=\"https://nra.bg/wps/portal/nra/actualno/vpisvane_v_registura_na_zaetostta_vuv_vruzka_s_opredelenata_mrz_ot_01.01.2026\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\">ПМС № 243 от 13.11.2025 г. (ДВ, бр. 98/2025), съобщение на НАП</a></span><a class=\"font-semibold\" href=\"/kalkulatori/danaci\">Виж повече</a></div></div><div class=\"bg-surface rounded-lg p-4 sm:p-5 flex flex-col\"><p class=\"text-sm sm:text-[15px] text-muted\">Кошница от 20 основни стоки</p><p class=\"display num text-[2rem] sm:text-[3.4rem] leading-none mt-2 break-words text-ink\">56,15 €</p><p class=\"text-sm sm:text-[15px] mt-2\">+3,6% от 05.01.2026 · по вериги и градове</p><div class=\"mt-auto pt-3 flex flex-wrap justify-between gap-x-2 gap-y-1 text-xs sm:text-sm\"><span class=\"text-muted\">Източник: <a href=\"https://kolkostruva.bg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\">КЗП, „Колко струва“</a></span><a class=\"font-semibold\" href=\"/ceni\">Виж повече</a></div></div></section><section class=\"mb-16\"><div class=\"flex items-end justify-between gap-4 mb-5\"><h2 class=\"display text-[2rem] sm:text-[2.4rem]\">Бърз поглед</h2></div><div class=\"grid gap-5 lg:grid-cols-3\"><div class=\"ring-1 ring-rule rounded-lg p-5 bg-white\"><p class=\"font-semibold\">Парламентът: програмата от миналата седмица</p><p class=\"text-sm text-muted mb-3\">18 ноември 2026 г.<!-- --> – <!-- -->20 ноември 2026 г.<!-- --> · новата програма излиза след гласуването ѝ в сряда</p><ol class=\"space-y-2.5 text-[15px]\"><li class=\"leading-snug\"><span class=\"text-xs font-semibold bg-surface rounded-full px-2 py-0.5 mr-1.5\">2-ро четене</span><a href=\"/parlament/zakon/chuzhdentsite-v-republika-balgariya\">Законопроект за изменение и допълнение на Закона за чужденците в Република България</a></li><li class=\"leading-snug\"><span class=\"text-xs font-semibold bg-surface rounded-full px-2 py-0.5 mr-1.5\">1-во четене</span><a href=\"/parlament/zakon/lova-i-opazvane-na-divecha\">Законопроекти за изменение и допълнение на Закона за лова и опазване на дивеча</a></li><li class=\"leading-snug\"><span class=\"text-xs font-semibold bg-surface rounded-full px-2 py-0.5 mr-1.5\">1-во четене</span><a href=\"/parlament/zakon/hazarta\">Законопроекти за изменение и допълнение на Закона за хазарта</a></li><li class=\"leading-snug\"><span class=\"text-xs font-semibold bg-surface rounded-full px-2 py-0.5 mr-1.5\">1-во четене</span><a href=\"/parlament/zakon/schetovodstvoto\">Законопроект за изменение и допълнение на Закона за счетоводството</a></li></ol><p class=\"text-sm mt-3\"><a href=\"/parlament#programa\">Цялата програма</a></p></div><div class=\"ring-1 ring-rule rounded-lg p-5 bg-white\"><p class=\"font-semibold\">Последно проучване</p><p class=\"text-sm text-muted mb-3\">Маркет ЛИНКС<!-- -->, <!-- -->19 октомври 2026 г.<!-- --> · дял от решилите да гласуват</p><ul class=\"space-y-1.5 text-[15px]\"><li class=\"grid grid-cols-[8.5rem_1fr_3rem] items-center gap-2\"><span class=\"truncate\">Прогресивна България</span><span class=\"h-2.5 bg-surface rounded-full overflow-hidden\"><span class=\"block h-full bg-green\" style=\"width:100%\"></span></span><span class=\"num text-right\">32<!-- -->%</span></li><li class=\"grid grid-cols-[8.5rem_1fr_3rem] items-center gap-2\"><span class=\"truncate\">ПП</span><span class=\"h-2.5 bg-surface rounded-full overflow-hidden\"><span class=\"block h-full bg-green\" style=\"width:31.874999999999996%\"></span></span><span class=\"num text-right\">10,2<!-- -->%</span></li><li class=\"grid grid-cols-[8.5rem_1fr_3rem] items-center gap-2\"><span class=\"truncate\">ГЕРБ</span><span class=\"h-2.5 bg-surface rounded-full overflow-hidden\"><span class=\"block h-full bg-green\" style=\"width:30%\"></span></span><span class=\"num text-right\">9,6<!-- -->%</span></li><li class=\"grid grid-cols-[8.5rem_1fr_3rem] items-center gap-2\"><span class=\"truncate\">ДБ</span><span class=\"h-2.5 bg-surface rounded-full overflow-hidden\"><span class=\"block h-full bg-green\" style=\"width:23.75%\"></span></span><span class=\"num text-right\">7,6<!-- -->%</span></li><li class=\"grid grid-cols-[8.5rem_1fr_3rem] items-center gap-2\"><span class=\"truncate\">ДПС–НН</span><span class=\"h-2.5 bg-surface rounded-full overflow-hidden\"><span class=\"block h-full bg-green\" style=\"width:17.5%\"></span></span><span class=\"num text-right\">5,6<!-- -->%</span></li><li class=\"grid grid-cols-[8.5rem_1fr_3rem] items-center gap-2\"><span class=\"truncate\">Възраждане</span><span class=\"h-2.5 bg-surface rounded-full overflow-hidden\"><span class=\"block h-full bg-green\" style=\"width:13.750000000000002%\"></span></span><span class=\"num text-right\">4,4<!-- -->%</span></li></ul><p class=\"text-sm mt-3\"><a href=\"https://www.marketlinks.bg/bg/news/obshtestvenopoliticheski-naglasi-oktomvri-2026-120.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\">Източник</a> · <a href=\"/proverki/sotsiologiya\">Колко точни са агенциите</a></p></div><div class=\"ring-1 ring-rule rounded-lg p-5 bg-white\"><p class=\"font-semibold\">Парите на 