an><span class=\"num whitespace-nowrap\">2.08<!-- --> € <span class=\"text-red\">+7,2%</span></span></li><li class=\"flex justify-between gap-3\"><span>Портокали, 1 кг</span><span class=\"num whitespace-nowrap\">1.59<!-- --> € <span class=\"text-green\">-17,2%</span></span></li><li class=\"flex justify-between gap-3\"><span>Лимони, 1 кг</span><span class=\"num whitespace-nowrap\">1.92<!-- --> € <span class=\"text-green\">-14,3%</span></span></li><li class=\"flex justify-between gap-3\"><span>Баница</span><span class=\"num whitespace-nowrap\">1.20<!-- --> € <span class=\"text-green\">-13,0%</span></span></li></ul><p class=\"text-sm mt-3\"><a href=\"/ceni\">Цени по вериги и градове</a> · <a href=\"/ceni/nadcenki\">Надценки</a></p></div></div></section><section class=\"mb-14\"><div class=\"flex items-end justify-between gap-4 mb-5\"><h2 class=\"display text-[2rem] sm:text-[2.4rem]\">Калкулатори</h2><div class=\"text-[15px] pb-1\"><a href=\"/kalkulatori\">Всички</a></div></div><ul class=\"grid grid-cols-2 sm:grid-cols-3 lg:grid-cols-5 gap-3\"><li><a class=\"group block h-full no-underline rounded-lg p-4 sm:p-5 bg-white ring-1 ring-rule hover:ring-green hover:bg-surface\" href=\"/kalkulatori/kredit\"><span class=\"display block text-[1.4rem] sm:text-[1.7rem] leading-tight text-ink group-hover:text-green\">Кредит</span><span class=\"hidden sm:block text-muted text-[15px] mt-2\">Колко ще ви струва и дали банката ще ви го отпусне.</span></a></li><li><a class=\"group block h-full no-underline rounded-lg p-4 sm:p-5 bg-white ring-1 ring-rule hover:ring-green hover:bg-surface\" href=\"/kalkulatori/lichna-inflaciya\"><span class=\"display block text-[1.4rem] sm:text-[1.7rem] leading-tight text-ink group-hover:text-green\">Лична инфлация</span><span class=\"hidden sm:block text-muted text-[15px] mt-2\">Колко са поскъпнали точно вашите разходи.</span></a></li><li><a class=\"group block h-full no-underline rounded-lg p-4 sm:p-5 bg-white ring-1 ring-rule hover:ring-green hover:bg-su